=== PARITY (vs web EndpointSidebar.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> the web leaf is presentational (props: endpoints/selected/onSelect; only hook is
    useTranslation). The native surface binds the endpoint catalogue through the shared state-holder seam
    (EndpointCatalogSource -> EndpointSidebarModel); the production app wires a source over the KMP
    OpenAPI/admin state holder fed by the parser the web ApiPlaygroundPage runs. The view performs NO HTTP.
    Selection is forwarded to the host via onSelect (web `onSelect(ep)`).
  Projection -> EndpointSidebarBuilder is a 1:1 port of the two web useMemo blocks + defaultOpen:
      filtered = !search.trim() ? all : filter(path|summary|operationId contains q.toLowerCase())
      grouped  = Map<tag || 'Other', endpoints[]> with first-seen insertion order preserved
      defaultOpen = selected?.tag === tag || grouped.size <= 5
    VERIFIED by the executed harness below (18/18).
  Composition -> bordered column: search box (web UiInput + search icon) · "{filtered.length} endpoints"
    meta row · scrolling collapsible tag groups (chevron + UPPER tag + count chip) · endpoint rows
    (MethodBadge + mono path + selected accent rule). MethodBadge tone table maps the web METHOD_COLORS
    (GET→green/success, POST→blue/info, PUT→amber/warning, DELETE→red/danger, PATCH→purple/accent, else
    neutral) — asserted against TSTone token colours.
  Shared components -> @/components/ui mapped to the REAL apps/apple library: TSTone (Badges), TSSkeleton
    (Feedback), Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius/TSMotion (P1/S9 tokens), ContentUnavailableView (SDK).
    Compiled against the real library in the typecheck below. Recharts->none / Leaflet->none.
  States (all render) -> loading (skeleton rows) · empty (catalogue empty, friendly ContentUnavailableView)
    · error (inline retry) · stale (freshness chip + reconnecting banner) · offline (cached + chip + banner)
    · content (search + count + groups). Within content, an empty search filter renders the EXACT web
    "No matching endpoints" branch (playground.noResults). Cached endpoints stay visible behind refresh/
    errors, matching the web parent's behaviour.
  i18n -> all 3 source strings resolve through the P1/S10 facade with the web t(key,default) fallback:
      playground.search    ("Search endpoints...")   — search field
      playground.endpoints ("endpoints")             — count meta row
      playground.noResults ("No matching endpoints") — filtered-empty state
    ALL 3 PRESENT in EndpointSidebar.strings. No English literals in native UI copy (dynamic path/tag/count
    text is Text(verbatim:) DATA, not UI copy). Native chrome/a11y keys carry the playground.* namespace.
  a11y -> every interactive element labelled: search field (+ clear button), each endpoint row (combined
    method+path+summary, .isSelected trait when selected), each group header (tag+count, expanded/collapsed
    value, toggle hint, .isButton), refresh/retry. Decorative icons .accessibilityHidden(true). Dynamic Type
    via Font.TS tokens; Reduce Motion respected on the chevron animation. EndpointSidebarAccessibility is a
    pure, unit-tested seam.
  Telemetry -> EndpointSidebarModel.start() emits viewOpened(surface:"EndpointSidebar") -> bridges shared
    Telemetry.track(.screenView) (P1/S11). Asserted once-only by a spy test.

